---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro'; import FeatureCard from '../components/FeatureCard.astro'; import CallToAction from '../components/CallToAction.astro';
const groups=[['Station control','Authenticated station controls, configuration, Now Playing and upcoming-track information.'],['Media and playlists','Import and catalogue operator-owned media, then create and organise playlists.'],['Scheduling','Scheduled programming with playlist rules and BPM-aware selection.'],['Audio analysis','Analysis supplies tempo information used by the Community scheduling path.'],['Transitions','Configure fade-in, fade-out, overlap, bridges, track exits, queues and prefetch.'],['Playout engine','A dedicated Rust engine runs automated radio playout from explicit FlowCast configuration.'],['Icecast delivery','Versioned services deliver the configured station stream through Icecast.'],['History and supervision','Inspect engine history, runtime state, service health, logs and diagnostics.'],['Backup and operations','Repository scripts cover diagnosis, backup, restore, update and rollback.'],['Optional Pro capabilities','Separately licensed capabilities may include documented Bliss acoustic similarity and advanced programming strategies.']];
---
<BaseLayout title="Features — Self-hosted radio automation software | FlowCast" description="Explore FlowCast station control, radio scheduling, audio analysis, transitions, Rust playout, Icecast delivery and operations."><section class="page container"><header class="page-head"><p class="eyebrow">FEATURES</p><h1>Radio automation from scheduling to Icecast delivery</h1><p>FlowCast is Docker radio automation software for operators who want an authenticated, self-hosted control plane and an explicit automated playout path.</p></header><div class="grid">{groups.map(([title,text])=><FeatureCard title={title}>{text}</FeatureCard>)}</div><section class="prose"><h2>A connected system</h2><p>Media, playlists, radio scheduling software, analysis, transitions and delivery share one station model. That integration is the core design choice—not a claim that FlowCast fits every broadcast workflow.</p><p>FlowCast is currently a Preview. Public OCI images may not exist for every tag or architecture, and endurance, rootless Docker, large-library and disaster-recovery qualification remain incomplete.</p></section></section><CallToAction/></BaseLayout>
